Name: FrontCamFix
Description: 当应用请求调用前置摄像头时，自动使用后置摄像头适用于前置摄像头损坏的手机：打开前置摄像头的应用（FaceTime、视频通话、自拍以及身份核验类应用）会出现卡死问题。FrontCamFix 会将后置摄像头提供给这些应用，让应用可以正常运行。也适合想要在仅支持前置摄像头的应用里使用后置摄像头的用户。
Author: muratkurt
Icon: https://muratkurt.github.io/assets/frontcamfix/icon.png
* For phones with a broken front camera: apps that open it (FaceTime, video calls, selfie and ID checks) freeze. FrontCamFix hands them the rear camera instead, so they keep working. Also for anyone who wants the rear camera in an app that only offers the front one.
* Works in every app, FaceTime and Safari included. The front camera is never started. Settings: on/off, mirroring, excluded apps.
Installed-Size: 432

